; Hero status/trigger code - not the hazard timer (that's $5C07). Every change
; funnels through #R$AE84/#R$AE85, which also zeroes $5C07 as it stores the new
; code; 0 is the idle/reset value, and the ~18 other codes each mark one
; specific event or scripted zone the hero is in (#R$A6CC dispatches per-frame
; handling on it). Restored on respawn from $5C2B (#R$9090). See Actors.md for
; the full code table with its setting call sites - the meanings there are
; inferred from call-site context, not confirmed against on-screen animation.
