; Multi-stage animation sequence, dispatched by stage counter ($5C41)
;
; .
;
; .
;
; A scripted, one-shot fanfare animation for a fixed object, played out over
; several stages as fields of it step toward target values, with a sound effect
; at each stage change. Most likely the room-$28 warp fanfare set up by
; #R$B6EE, not everyday gameplay logic.
c$B0B6 LD IY,$5B08     ; IY=object ($5B08)
 $B0BA LD HL,$5C41     ; HL=stage counter ($5C41)
 $B0BD LD A,(HL)       ;
 $B0BE OR A            ; {stage counter==0?
